{{#is_alert}}A real listing import failed after retries and browser fallback. The dedicated failure counter triggered this alert; logs are only for diagnosis. Inspect listing_source, reason and http_status in backend logs and check the proxy and seloger-browser service.{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_recovery}}No final import access failures were recorded in the last 15 minutes. Consult the scheduled probe monitors for active provider health.{{/is_recovery}}

Covers email and manual imports for all providers. HTTP 404/410 removals and recovered browser challenges are excluded. Photo and LLM failures are outside this alert. After fixing an outage, replay affected emails with backend/scripts/reprocess_emails.py using a bounded time window or specific email IDs.
